/figures/

# Internal analysis design docs / scratch notes -- kept outside the repo
KinematicFeatureDecompositionAnalys.md

# Imported reference (lab's historical DLC / R analysis project, ~584MB) -- external,
# kept local only as a reading reference for kinematic PCA conventions
mousedb/historical_kinematic_analysis/

# Agent/personal notes -- never published. See CLAUDE.md on notes placement.
.notes/

# Accessory/analysis leftovers that must never reach this public repo.
# endpoint_ck_analysis was removed from the tool repo as an accessory, but its
# on-disk _bundled_data still holds a full copy of connectome.db and cached
# parquet of real animal data. Untracked and unignored, a single `git add -A`
# would publish the research database. Ignore the whole tree.
mousedb/endpoint_ck_analysis/
endpoint_ck_analysis/
*.db
